OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of
OL,6,Frain will push northwards during the
OL,7,Fevening, heavy at times. Drier and
OL,8,Fclearer conditions returning from the
OL,9,Fwest later in the night along with a
OL,10,Fscattering of showers.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FBright spells and showers,
OL,13,Fheaviest and most frequent in the west
OL,14,Flater in the day with the best of any
OL,15,Fsunshine around Inverness and the
OL,16,Feast. Breezy, strong coastal winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
